          {
            "document": "python-3.14-docs-text/library/json.txt",
            "excerpt": "Unlike \"pickle\" and \"marshal\", JSON is not a framed protocol, so trying to serialize multiple objects with repeated calls to \"dump()\" using the same *fp* will result in an invalid JSON file. * **fp** (*file-like object*) -- The file-like object *obj* will be serialized to. The \"j",
