          },
          {
            "document": "python-3.14-docs-text/library/json.txt",
            "excerpt": "JSON (JavaScript Object Notation), specified by **RFC 7159** (which obsoletes **RFC 4627**) and by ECMA-404, is a lightweight data interchange format inspired by JavaScript object literal syntax (although it is not a strict subset of JavaScript [1] ). The term \"object\" in the con",
            "page_id": 3,
            "record_id": "7409230c3d31263ba576b2d1",
